mechanism "Pinacol rearrangement"

C[C:1]([CH3:7])([O:2][H:8])[C:3](C)(C)[OH:4] + [H:5][OH2+:6]
  lp 4 -> 5
  bond 5-6 -> 6
-->
C[C:1]([CH3:7])([O:2][H:8])[C:3](C)(C)[OH+:4][H:5] + [OH2:6]
  bond 3-4 -> 4
--> "loss of water"
C[C:1]([CH3:7])([O:2][H:8])[C+:3](C)C + [H:5][OH:4]
  bond 1-7 -> 7-3
--> "1,2-methyl shift"
C[C+:1]([O:2][H:8])[C:3](C)(C)[CH3:7] + [OH2:6]
  lp 2 -> 2-1
<->
C[C:1](=[O+:2][H:8])[C:3](C)(C)[CH3:7] + [OH2:6]
  lp 6 -> 8
  bond 8-2 -> 2
-->
C[C:1](=[O:2])[C:3](C)(C)[CH3:7] + [H:8][OH2+:6]
